{"id":"lesson-1716","topicId":1716,"title":"第七单元","sourceTitle":"第七单元","blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1716","createdAt":"2024-08-21T13:28:33Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-21T13:28:33Z","postCount":1,"excerpt":"人们生活在自然之中,而大自然也已深深融入人 类的精神世界,成为人类心灵的寄托。通过文学作品 对自然的描写反观自然,可以提升对自然美的感悟力, 激发对自然和生活的热爱之情。 本单元选取的五篇散文,都是写景抒情的名篇, 有对故都“秋味”的吟唱,对荷塘月色的描写;有北京 地坛牵出的人生故事;有夜游赤壁的吊古伤今,登临 东岳的畅想。在对大地山川、风物美景的描写中徜徉, 既可以受到美的熏陶,又能够领会深厚的人文内涵。 学习本单元的写景抒情散文,体会民族审美心理, 提升文学欣赏品位,培养对自然的热爱之情。要关注作 品中的自然景物描写和人生思考,体会作者观察、欣赏 和表现自然景物的角度,分析情景交融、情理结合的手 法;还要反复涵泳咀嚼,感受作品的文辞之美。","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_上册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 上册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a","tocLabel":"第七单元","tocScore":1.11,"startPage":111,"pages":[111],"pageImages":[{"page":111,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p111.webp","label":"p111","matched":true}],"contextPages":[91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109,110,111,112,113,114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126,127,128,129,130,131],"contextPageImages":[{"page":91,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p91.webp","label":"p91","matched":false},{"page":92,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p92.webp","label":"p92","matched":false},{"page":93,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p93.webp","label":"p93","matched":false},{"page":94,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p94.webp","label":"p94","matched":false},{"page":95,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p95.webp","label":"p95","matched":false},{"page":96,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p96.webp","label":"p96","matched":false},{"page":97,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p97.webp","label":"p97","matched":false},{"page":98,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p98.webp","label":"p98","matched":false},{"page":99,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p99.webp","label":"p99","matched":